      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "No one with moderation powers have immunity from moderator kicking. If you have moderation powers in an instance, you can kick anyone.\n\nThere are multiple bug reports about this issue. See: [can-kick-group-owner-from-instance](https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/can-kick-group-owner-from-instance)\n\nAt least now that we have an audit log entry for kicks happening in a group's instances, the owner can punish their subordinates if they kick them.\n\nThe more interesting question is, where does the world author belong in the hierarchy of who can kick who? See: [world-owner-can-be-kicked-by-the-instance-owner](https://vrchat.canny.io/bug-reports/p/world-owner-can-be-kicked-by-the-instance-owner) and: [disable-group-instance-ability-to-kick-world-authors](https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/disable-group-instance-ability-to-kick-world-authors)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
